Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:05.86,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Is she having another nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.79,0:00:12.74,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,Now she won't have any scary dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:24.18,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:28.46,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,This is bad! My vision's been taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.71,0:00:31.88,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,Was that a demi-human?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:34.30,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,What do I do? My sight isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.15,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.61,0:00:41.88,italics,Rio,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.96,top,Sara,0,0,0,,Careful, Uzuma. I think he's \Nusing some kind of spirit art!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.66,top,Orphia,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's a spirit art that \Ndetects the od in the area, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.66,0:01:00.66,top,Alma,0,0,0,,But we should probably assume \Nthat he knows our numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.90,0:01:02.15,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.62,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Are you demi-humans?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:07.04,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If you are, I'd like to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:10.27,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,Sara, humans are a dishonorable lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:14.40,top,Sara,0,0,0,,I know. But we need to \Nlearn what his aims are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:17.76,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,In that case, we should prepare \Nfor the worst case scenario...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.76,0:01:20.57,top,Sara,0,0,0,,Orphia, Alma, for now, investigate in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:21.53,top,Orphia,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.53,0:01:23.66,top,Alma,0,0,0,,Will do, Sara.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.66,0:01:25.18,top,Sara,0,0,0,,Uzuma, stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.50,0:01:26.46,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.07,0:01:30.71,main,Sara,0,0,0,,We shall accept your proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:32.36,main,Sara,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:37.36,main,Sara,0,0,0,,We would rather you not refer to us by \Nthe derogatory epithet "demi-human."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I thank you for your ready consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:43.37,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am called Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.77,0:01:45.50,main,Rio,0,0,0,,With regard to the term I used,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:49.38,main,Rio,0,0,0,,it was not my intent to cause \Nany offense. I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:50.83,top,Alma,0,0,0,,Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:52.44,top,Orphia,0,0,0,,There's a child of the beast people here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:55.23,top,Alma,0,0,0,,It looks like spirit arts have \Nbeen used to make her sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:00.72,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Uzuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:03.20,top,Sara,0,0,0,,I haven't given any orders yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:07.04,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,He's a marauder who has kidnapped \None of our kin. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:10.25,top,Alma,0,0,0,,Watch out! He's using \Nsome kind of spirit art!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.46,0:02:10.98,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.00,top,Orphia,0,0,0,,It seems like some kind \Nof healing spirit art.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.48,0:02:14.90,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:17.61,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.85,0:02:20.16,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:26.00,main,Sara,0,0,0,,We have ascertained that you \Nhave one of our kin in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.95,main,Sara,0,0,0,,As we have questions about this situation,\N we will have you restrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:30.50,main,Rio,0,0,0,,This is a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:33.71,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I was hoping that you would take \Nher under your protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:38.77,main,Uzuma,0,0,0,,Who would trust a human's... \Nmuch less a kidnapper's word?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:41.76,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I didn't kidnap her! Listen to—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:45.01,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.21,top,Uzuma,0,0,0,,Your actions are needless.
