Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.43,0:04:35.37,sign_5131_21_Memories_of_the_,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\c&H87FFF1&\fad(505,1)\pos(110,295)\clip(68,291,151,297)}Forest of Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:34.62,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:42.50,main,Rio,0,0,0,,You... Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:45.76,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Me? I... wonder who I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.29,main,Rio,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.29,0:04:48.26,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.51,0:04:51.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,But you know about me, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.77,0:04:53.61,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,About you, Haruto?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:56.32,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Haruto is... Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:59.27,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's not really an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.53,0:05:02.20,main,Rio,0,0,0,,In that case, why do you know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.61,0:05:06.38,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Because I'm connected to you, Haruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.38,0:05:08.42,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Connected to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:10.26,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Yes. It's still too soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:13.75,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,But I belong only to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.14,0:05:16.57,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:21.75,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It seems our time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:22.90,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:26.76,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,Yes. This is all I can do.\N It isn't much, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:29.60,main,Aishia,0,0,0,,At least you'll have sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.57,main,Miharu,0,0,0,,Haru-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.57,0:05:36.08,main,Miharu,0,0,0,,Haru-kun, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.62,0:05:40.86,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Mii-chan? Mii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:43.67,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Mii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:45.26,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Mii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:47.20,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Mii-chan—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.05,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:55.00,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.81,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Latifa...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.81,0:05:59.33,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:02.46,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,You were gone, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:05.38,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,I don't want that! Don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.40,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:09.28,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Could you please hug me a little more gently?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:12.11,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Huh? Are you hurt? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:13.96,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:19.19,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.19,0:06:24.65,top,Ursula,0,0,0,,Dear, dear. Can you not walk a little slower?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:27.07,top,Ursula,0,0,0,,As I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:30.38,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Human boy, our apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:35.72,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,I would like to hear about that young girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.93,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Can I ask for your cooperation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.93,0:06:41.54,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,More importantly, were you the ones\N who did this to Onii-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:42.90,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.75,main,Uzuma,0,0,0,,Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.71,main,Uzuma,0,0,0,,I offer my sincerest apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.82,0:06:52.22,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Please, allow us to apologize, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.64,main,Sara; Orphia; Alma,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, truly, you have \Nour most sincere apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:59.63,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If the misunderstanding has been resolved, \Nthat's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:04.25,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Uzuma will take full responsibility \Nfor her thoughtless actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.70,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,As will these girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:08.24,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.61,0:07:11.34,main,Rio,0,0,0,,But for now, everyone, \Nplease raise your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:14.67,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Orphia, quickly now. Aren't you going \Nto release his shackles for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.67,0:07:15.74,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:21.07,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, tomorrow morning,\N the Elders will gather
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:24.13,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,to give you a formal apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:28.13,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,For tonight, I apologize that all we \Ncan offer is this humble room,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.13,0:07:31.77,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,but I hope you and Miss Latifa will \Nbe able to rest well here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:35.16,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Thank you very much. \NWe will accept your kind offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:39.58,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Good. I have many preparations \Nthat must be made as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.77,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,If you'll allow me, I'll excuse myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:15.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:21.13,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,That is the World Tree in which the great \NDryas, a spirit of mighty trees, resides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.13,0:08:22.31,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Big, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:23.24,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:27.61,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Heading for that tree is \Nwhat brought me this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.77,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.77,0:08:34.29,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,A high-level illusion magic barrier\N is erected around that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:37.29,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Without considerable knowledge \Nof the spirit arts,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:39.03,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,one should not be able \Nto see through it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.23,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.45,0:08:46.99,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, you were not apprenticed under \Nanyone in the spirit arts, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.99,0:08:52.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If what I use is the spirit arts, \Nthen I'm basically self-educated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:54.00,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:57.72,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,What an outrageous talent you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:00.18,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:05.21,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, please sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:10.13,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Well, shall we commence \Nthis council of the Elders?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:14.57,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,As we have asked the human boy \Nto be present on this occasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.57,0:09:18.41,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,we shall proceed using \Nthe language of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.41,0:09:22.34,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,I am one of the Eldest, who bring \Ntogether the People of the Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:25.41,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,who live in this village. \NI am called Syldora.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.41,0:09:28.99,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,These two beside me are also of the Eldest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.67,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,You already know Ursula.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.23,0:09:34.22,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,This dwarf man here is—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:38.16,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,I'm Dominic! Nice to meet you, human kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:42.18,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,As you can see, he has quite \Na forthright personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:45.18,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,I apologize if he causes any offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.85,0:09:48.08,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I thank you for your courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.32,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am called Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:54.70,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Please, there is no need for \Nsuch deference, Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.46,0:10:00.20,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Considering our misunderstanding \Ncaused such great troubles from our kin,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.20,0:10:05.54,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,and that you freed one of our kin \Nwho had been taken into slavery,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:10.28,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,we offer you our apologies and \Nour most heartfelt thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.67,0:10:14.20,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I am honored by your words \Nof apology and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.64,0:10:19.31,main,Rio,0,0,0,,The fault lies also with me, for so \Nthoughtlessly setting foot in your domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:21.52,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Please, raise your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.98,0:10:25.31,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Your generous understanding \Nmakes our hearts ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:31.34,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,We were hoping we might be able to do \Nsomething as a sign of our gratitude, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.07,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.43,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,As we are of different peoples,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.43,0:10:42.07,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,it is difficult for us to determine what \Nwould show our gratitude to you, Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.07,0:10:44.07,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I see. In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:47.58,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Would you take Latifa into your care?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.14,0:10:51.18,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, that is {\i1}our{\i0} wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:55.77,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,It is something we should be bowing \Nour heads and asking of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Though you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:01.61,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Please, tell us what you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:10.85,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If it were possible, right now, she... \NI think she's grown attached to me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:14.35,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, please, you do not \Nneed to say anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.80,0:11:19.74,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,For Latifa's sake, won't you live here \Nwith her in the village for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:21.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,You wouldn't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.59,0:11:22.65,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,We would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:25.90,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,All of the Eldest here are in agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:28.12,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,We would like to ask you to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.65,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,That's right! Quit being so polite!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:33.29,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,You're an even better man than \NUrsula made you out to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:34.85,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,I like you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:38.13,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Yes, it's just as Ursula and Dominic say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:41.01,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,We intend to take every measure to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:43.77,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,living in this village \Nposes no inconvenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:48.99,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,If you discover anything you want in the\N meantime, please don't hesitate to tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.99,0:11:51.81,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,That's right! And it doesn't \Nhave to be an object.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:55.42,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,You can even marry one of \Nthe girls from our village!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.60,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Dominic, don't get so carried away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:00.78,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Are you drunk already, you scoundrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:04.99,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, that's the way things stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.85,main,Rio,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.23,0:12:10.25,main,Rio,0,0,0,,While I live in the village,\N then, the spirit arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.57,0:12:13.57,main,Rio,0,0,0,,And any knowledge that seems \Nuseful for daily life...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.57,0:12:15.37,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If I could be taught such things...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.37,0:12:16.61,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.40,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Something like that should be\N no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:23.05,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Indeed. We'll need to find \Nan accomplished teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:26.22,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Well, it seems that conversation \Nhas come to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:29.47,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Would it be all right to \Nmove on to my business?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:42.98,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Why... Lady Dryas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.43,0:12:50.72,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, the personage before you is the \Nspirit of the World Tree, Lady Dryas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.08,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What? A spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.85,0:12:57.59,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.13,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes, pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.54,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Hmm, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:06.31,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,It's very weak, but I sense the \Npresence of a spirit within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:09.08,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Is it... sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.93,main,Rio,0,0,0,,A spirit? Inside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.93,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Yes. Do you have an idea what it might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.74,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,I think you've probably made a covenant with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:18.49,main,Rio,0,0,0,,A covenant? No, I don't have any \Nparticular memory of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.89,0:13:21.44,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,I see. That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.50,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,If you make a covenant with a spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:26.62,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,things like an inability \Nto use magic often occur,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.62,0:13:28.64,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,which can be difficult for a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:31.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh. In that case, I've definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.97,0:13:34.50,flashback,Alphonse,0,0,0,,There is one person who can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:37.80,flashback,Stewart,0,0,0,,You're a hindrance who can't even use magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.80,0:13:40.13,flashback,Stewart,0,0,0,,but we've prepared a job that even you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:45.09,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Say, would it be all right \Nif I looked into it a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:47.10,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:49.34,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Then, please excuse the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:59.31,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,My! You have an incredible \Namount of od hidden inside you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.31,0:14:02.55,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,It looks delicious! Are you really a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.17,0:14:03.94,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.64,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Did you find something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:09.89,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,More than something, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:16.16,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,It's like there's a person-shaped spirit...\Nsleeping inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.15,0:14:19.77,main,Rio,0,0,0,,A person-shaped spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.14,0:14:25.59,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Hmm, with that reaction, I'd guess you don't \Nknow how rare a person-shaped spirit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:27.15,main,Rio,0,0,0,,N-No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:28.60,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,To put it simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.60,0:14:31.64,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Spirits that can take the \Nshape of a person, like me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.72,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,are of the second-highest class or greater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.72,0:14:40.45,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,So one of these person-shaped \Nspirits sleeps within Sir Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:41.39,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:45.53,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,The spirits of the highest class, \Nonce called the Six Great Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:52.24,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,all went missing in the Divine-Demon War\N over a thousand years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.03,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,The spirit sleeping within Rio...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:59.21,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,may be one of those\N high-class spirits, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.42,0:15:04.59,main,Rio,0,0,0,,If... If it is a high-class spirit, \Nwould that cause some kind of problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.87,0:15:06.80,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,I don't think so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:10.51,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,Oh, but for the children of the village, \Nit might be a matter of great importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.00,0:15:13.45,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,I'm only a spirit of the second-highest class,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.45,0:15:15.76,main,Dryas,0,0,0,,and they've gone and \Ndeified me, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:16.93,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.92,0:15:19.45,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:20.77,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,It would mean that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:26.01,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,we must once again rethink the manner \Nin which we treat you, Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:26.86,main,Rio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:29.51,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,To put it plainly, Sir Rio,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:33.75,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,we would discuss whether it would \Nbe better to treat you as a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.99,main,Rio,0,0,0,,A... saint?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.40,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Don't worry about the details!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:43.38,main,Dominic,0,0,0,,Just think of it getting extra-special\N treatment while you're in our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.51,0:15:46.13,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'll do that, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:01.62,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.76,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:12.40,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Onii-chan! This house is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.92,0:16:15.05,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,It has an open-air bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:17.71,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,A kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.71,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,A beautiful view.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:21.40,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.92,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:29.12,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.41,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:35.34,main,Amla,0,0,0,,Oryza grains are threshed to remove \Nthe hulls, then cooked with saffron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:37.37,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oryza?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:38.14,main,Amla,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.14,0:16:42.31,main,Amla,0,0,0,,It's a foodstuff that originated \Nin the Yagumo region.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.31,0:16:44.95,main,Amla,0,0,0,,Do you not have it in the Strahl region?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:46.31,main,Rio,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.31,0:16:49.84,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,That's right! They have rice here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.26,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,Rice! Rice!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:53.97,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,What are you saying? You're so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.97,0:16:56.28,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,But, I mean, it's okome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.85,0:17:01.31,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Um... I was wondering, Sir Rio,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:05.42,main,Sara,0,0,0,,which rooms would you like us to sleep in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:06.94,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:09.98,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Huh? Um... The Eldest...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.98,0:17:13.03,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Lady Ursula didn't mention anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.03,0:17:15.18,main,Rio,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:20.50,main,Sara,0,0,0,,The three of us are to live here in this \Nhouse and look after both of you, Sir Rio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:21.19,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.55,0:17:24.38,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,All of you are going to live here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.23,main,Orphia,0,0,0,,Yes. Would you rather we didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.69,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,I-I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:30.62,main,Rio,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:33.07,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Sir Rio, forgive the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.38,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Mistress Ursula...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:37.13,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Regarding Sara and the others \Nliving here with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:40.01,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,I humbly ask your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.51,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Though you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.80,0:17:45.79,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Won't it cause problems for them? \NLiving with a human like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:47.98,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,That's precisely why they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.98,0:17:53.17,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Talk of you and Latifa has already \Nspread among the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:57.52,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,If the higher-ups in the village approach \Nyou as they might some kind of abscess,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:17:59.38,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,that would be far worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.38,0:18:00.64,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.95,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,This is for Latifa's sake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:07.24,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Someone besides you who can \Nbe her guardian, her friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:10.65,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,She needs someone who will \Nstay by her side, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.78,main,Rio,0,0,0,,That is true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.98,main,Ursula,0,0,0,,Then we shall consider \Nthe matter settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:20.36,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh, well, I am grateful for \Nwhat it means for Latifa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:23.28,main,Rio,0,0,0,,As long as we aren't imposing\Non Miss Sara and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.47,main,Latifa,0,0,0,,That's wonderful, isn't it, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.82,0:18:30.18,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:33.39,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Not at all. It is I who \Nshould be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:35.34,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I will be counting on you from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.69,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Of course, Sir Rio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.69,0:18:38.76,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Oh... and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.14,0:18:42.54,main,Rio,0,0,0,,I would be grateful if you \Nwould stop using "sir" with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:45.72,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:48.33,main,Sara,0,0,0,,Would Master Rio be acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.67,0:18:51.73,main,Rio,0,0,0,,Yes, that will be fine. Please go with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:44.66,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,We will now begin the rites \Nfor the Grand Spirit Festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.94,0:19:48.16,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,Here, under the profound \Ngrace of the great spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:50.36,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,we hope that blessings \Nand divine protection
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:55.04,main,Syldora,0,0,0,,shall forever accompany us, the People \Nof the Spirits, on the path we travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.86,main,crowd,0,0,0,,Lady Dryas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:16.90,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Now, then, I believe it's \Nabout time to descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.07,0:20:20.35,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.35,0:20:21.36,main,boy,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.97,main,boy,0,0,0,,A-Are we going in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.15,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:32.58,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Around this time, the master of that \Ncave will be out looking for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.58,0:20:36.71,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,It won't be returning for a while,\N so please, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.50,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,You wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:47.74,flashback,Reiss,0,0,0,,Well done in making it this far in your \Neffort to join the Celestial Lion Brigade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:49.60,flashback,Reiss,0,0,0,,If you clear this next test,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.94,0:20:54.25,flashback,Reiss,0,0,0,,you will receive permission to officially \Njoin the brigade as a member.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.25,0:20:55.10,flashback,boy,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:21:01.29,italics,boy,0,0,0,,Oh, good! Now all that's left is to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.98,0:21:05.29,main,boy,0,0,0,,M-Master Reiss, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:08.73,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,It's obvious, isn't it? It's an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:10.29,main,boy,0,0,0,,Wh-What kind of egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:12.38,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,What's this? Would you really like to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:13.54,main,boy,0,0,0,,Oh! Um... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.54,0:21:15.96,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,We are considering what, after griffins,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:20.92,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,might be used to newly augment \Nthe Celestial Lion Brigade's military strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.92,0:21:21.88,main,boy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.29,0:21:25.07,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,You will carry this egg, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:28.61,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,I must manage the griffin, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.61,0:21:30.43,main,boy,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.81,0:21:34.01,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,Well then, let us return.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:39.27,main,boy,0,0,0,,The parent won't get angry and come \Nto take back the egg... right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.27,0:21:45.04,main,Reiss,0,0,0,,The distance between here and the Strahl \Nregion is considerable, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.03,0:21:48.74,main,boy,0,0,0,,That's true...
